---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Ledonie" description="Meet Ledonie — Perth astrologer, medium and tarot reader.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>About Ledonie</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">The Little Witch</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-content">
    <div class="about-image">
      <div class="image-placeholder">👁</div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2>A Message From Ledonie</h2>
      <p>
        I've always known that there was more to this world than what we see. From a young age, I felt the pull of the stars 
        and the presence of something beyond the veil. Growing up in Perth, I began studying astrology in my teens and 
        discovered a language that felt like coming home.
      </p>
      <p>
        My journey as a medium came later — a gift I came to understand and embrace through my own spiritual practice. 
        Connecting with loved ones who've crossed over, bringing through messages of love and reassurance — this is the 
        work that fills my soul.
      </p>
      <p>
        The tarot has been my companion through it all. Those 78 cards hold a universe of wisdom, and every reading 
        is a conversation between the seen and unseen, between you and your highest self.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you're seeking guidance on love, career, family, or your spiritual path — I believe the stars, 
        the cards, and spirit have something to say. Let me help you hear it.
      </p>

      <div class="credentials">
        <h3>Specialties</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>☽ Natal Chart Readings — understanding your cosmic blueprint</li>
          <li>👁 Mediumship — connecting with loved ones who've crossed</li>
          <li>🃏 Tarot & Oracle Readings — guidance from the cards</li>
          <li>★ Transit Reports — what the heavens are doing for you right now</li>
          <li>🌙 Weekly & Monthly Horoscopes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="beliefs">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>My Approach</h2>
      <div class="beliefs-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Compassion First</h3>
          <p>Every reading is held in a safe, non-judgmental space. Your story, your struggles, your joy — it's all welcome here.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>No Sugar-Coating</h3>
          <p>The stars don't lie, and neither will I. What the cards and the cosmos show me, I share with honesty and care.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Empowerment Over Dependency</h3>
          <p>My goal is to help you find your own inner wisdom — not to keep you coming back for answers you already have.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.page-header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a3562, #2d1f47);
  color: white; text-align: center; padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
}
.page-header h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; }
.page-header .subtitle { color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }

.about-content {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr; gap: 4rem;
  max-width: 1000px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 2rem; align-items: start;
}
.image-placeholder {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), var(--deep-purple));
  border-radius: 8px; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 5rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
}
.about-text h2 { font-size: 2rem; color: var(--deep-purple); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.about-text p { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.02rem; }
.credentials { margin-top: 2rem; }
.credentials h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--deep-purple); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
.credentials ul { list-style: none; }
.credentials li { padding: 0.4rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }

.beliefs { background: var(--cream); padding: 4rem 2rem; }
.beliefs h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--deep-purple); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
.beliefs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
.beliefs-grid h3 { color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.beliefs-grid p { font-size: 0.95rem; }

.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .about-image { max-width: 250px; margin: 0 auto; }
}
</style>